        <h2 class="h2">A clearance ends recorded, denied, invalidated, or as an <em>exception</em>.</h2>
        <p class="sub">The side states are what make uncertainty visible. A tier 2 or 3 change that Clearance couldn't verify is never reported as cleared.</p>
